What this repository does not contain:
  - Google applications or services (MindTheGapps). They are proprietary and covered by Google's
    terms. The published system image ("Lumen OS without Google", tools/build_system.sh GMS=0) does
    not contain them either. Users can add them on their own projector from their own MindTheGapps
    download (installer command 'gapps'). The install guide names the exact upstream file and its
    official URL. installer/lib/gapps_allow.txt (a copy of tools/ota/image/gapps_allow.txt) holds only
    the sha256, sizes and paths of that zip and its files.
  - MediaTek or XGIMI binaries. Public images carry 0-byte placeholders. The installer copies the
    nine MediaTek and XGIMI codec and audio files from the user's own projector
    (installer/lib/blobs_allow.txt lists only their sha256).
  - Signing keys. Only public certificates (keys/public, installer/certs) are published.

