projects, unmodified unless a patch in lineage/patches says otherwise):
  - The Android Open Source Project, Apache License 2.0 and the licenses listed in the image's
    /system/etc/NOTICE.xml.gz.
  - LineageOS 21, Apache License 2.0 (and the licenses of its components).
